N honestdid.pkg
D 23 Sep 2026
U 5
d 'HONESTDID': module implementing the HonestDiD R package
d 
d     Stata version of the HonestDiD R package, which implements
d robust inference for difference-in-differences and event study
d design    methods developed in Rambachan and Roth (2021). See the
d examples section below for an illustration of how users can use
d this   package to conduct sensitivity analysis on the parallel
d trends assumption in difference-in-differences and event study
d designs.
